& [Observation]
  + the first exact all-target workspace replay compiled the development fixture generator as an example test harness
  + its included B2A fixture modules exposed forty-five tests and three CLI tests refused because sibling binary paths are intentionally unavailable to an example harness
  + eighteen additional evidence targets refused stale transitive lib.rs identities as expected before final recursive rehash

& [Cause]
  + Cargo all-target discovery crossed the generator reuse boundary; test=false did not by itself erase included #[test] items from an explicitly selected example harness
  + a later native generator attempt was separately blocked by Windows Application Control error 4551

& [Correction]
  + cfg(not(test)) now removes generator-only includes use and main from test-harness compilation so the example contributes one zero-test result group
  + the producer now runs the exact offline generator through the admitted Ubuntu-24.04 WSL lane and reproduces the same 49431-byte fixture SHA256 27A233C7366063DA04371A137CE4E68AE8F5DD97479BF70BFEFB9B180CAB0004

& [Boundary]
  + no host-policy bypass provider network download live root or semantic weakening occurred
